# Input graphs for LA3D__cogitarelink-solid__tests_test_interop_foundation.py__test_addressbook_managers_assign_container_trees_and_name_their_container -- written during translation.
#
# The original reads FOUR separate Turtle files (one per manager slug),
# each with exactly one st:Manager subject named by its own file-relative
# `<>`. One physical file cannot host four independent `<>` documents, so
# this fixture addresses each manager by a synthetic root IRI instead
# (urn:ex:mgr:<slug>) -- driver.py re-partitions this single parsed graph
# into four ISOLATED per-slug graphs by subject closure from each manager
# root, which is the oracle's equivalent of "one file per manager": if the
# four were left in one shared graph, `next(g.subjects(RDF.type,
# ST.Manager))` / `m{ ?mgr a st:Manager }.one()` would have FOUR candidates
# instead of one, and which one comes back would depend on store iteration
# order rather than on the region's own logic.
#
# Content mirrors the real repo files (LA3D/cogitarelink-solid@4912150,
# overlays/addressbook/interop/managers/{person,organization,group,membership}.shapetree.ttl)
# up to the swap of `<>` for the synthetic root.
#
# Neighbourhood: a fifth assignment (urn:ex:decoy:a2) that belongs to no
# manager's st:hasAssignment -- must not leak into any of the four reads.
@prefix st: <http://www.w3.org/ns/shapetrees#> .
@prefix ab: <https://pod.vardeman.me/vault/meta/shapetrees/addressbook.tree#> .

<urn:ex:mgr:person> a st:Manager ;
    st:hasAssignment <urn:ex:mgr:person#a1> .
<urn:ex:mgr:person#a1> st:assigns ab:PersonContainerTree ;
    st:manages <https://pod.vardeman.me/vault/contacts/Person/> .

<urn:ex:mgr:organization> a st:Manager ;
    st:hasAssignment <urn:ex:mgr:organization#a1> .
<urn:ex:mgr:organization#a1> st:assigns ab:OrganizationContainerTree ;
    st:manages <https://pod.vardeman.me/vault/contacts/Organization/> .

<urn:ex:mgr:group> a st:Manager ;
    st:hasAssignment <urn:ex:mgr:group#a1> .
<urn:ex:mgr:group#a1> st:assigns ab:GroupContainerTree ;
    st:manages <https://pod.vardeman.me/vault/contacts/Group/> .

<urn:ex:mgr:membership> a st:Manager ;
    st:hasAssignment <urn:ex:mgr:membership#a1> .
<urn:ex:mgr:membership#a1> st:assigns ab:MembershipContainerTree ;
    st:manages <https://pod.vardeman.me/vault/contacts/Membership/> .

<urn:ex:decoy:a2> st:assigns ab:DecoyContainerTree ;
    st:manages <https://pod.vardeman.me/vault/contacts/Decoy/> .
